[PrintTextModified Text:やめて。|#0101Bad02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:やめてやめてやめてやめてやめて！|#0101Bad02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

